-- A rule over the pick-ups of fills that owe counselling. The spec does not declare
-- CounsellingDue.
--
-- The compiler prints the missing name, and then refuses the rule's `fill: fill` as a
-- CounsellingDue given where a Fill is declared, a second message for the same name.
act Fill { fillNumber: integer }

transient act PickUp { fill: one Fill }

act Counsel { fill: one Fill }

rule Note when (PickUp where fill is CounsellingDue) {
    Counsel from { fill: fill }
}
